WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Tappet adjusting screw
What it does: Allows cold clearance to be set between the operating mechanism and valve.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Tappet adjusting screw
How it works: The locknut secures the adjustment.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Tappet adjusting screw
How it moves: Retains its adjustment and swings with the rocker; does not self-adjust by turning.
